// Convex.xcconfig
// Convex deployment URL for team `nabeelo`, project `whistle`, deployment
// `grandiose-alpaca-243` (TECH-SPEC §2a — this deployment already exists
// and is targeted non-interactively). Not a secret (it's a public HTTPS
// endpoint), but kept out of source per TECH-SPEC's "env/xcconfig, never
// hardcoded" convention so switching deployments (e.g. a future prod vs.
// dev split) never requires a source-code change.

// NOTE: `//` begins a comment ANYWHERE in an xcconfig line, so a literal
// URL here silently truncated to `https:` (caught during U11 packaging
// verification — the built Info.plist carried CONVEX_URL="https:" and the
// app fell through to its hardcoded fallback). The empty substitution
// `$()` splits the two slashes without changing the resolved value.
CONVEX_URL = https:/$()/grandiose-alpaca-243.convex.cloud
